  "$comment": "Hand-labeled from the pinned sample source (scripts/samples.json), not from Concentrate output. There is no backend in the repository, so no routes. Components: every @Component class under src/ (the @Directive and @Pipe classes are not components), at its class line. Renders: every element of a template (inline or templateUrl) whose tag is the selector of a component the parent imports, one label per element, at its line in the template; app-root in src/index.html has no parent component. Pages: every route object of src/app/app.routes.ts and of src/app/features/profile/profile.routes.ts, which app.routes.ts lazy-loads under profile (loadChildren, default export), with kind layout for children/loadChildren, index for an empty child path, and the component it renders (loadComponent default exports, component). Calls: every call site in the method bodies of the listed files (field initializers there call only rxjs); constructor-injected services (private readonly x: Service) resolve to the service class's methods, and rxjs, Angular signals and Router calls stay unresolved.",
